{
  "name": "Missed Call Recovery Engine - HVAC (Fixed)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bug Fixes Applied\n\n1. **Twilio SMS node** \u2014 added missing `resource: sms` / `operation: send`. Without these the node doesn't know it's supposed to send a text.\n2. **ownerName** \u2014 was referenced in the SMS message but never set anywhere. Added it in 'Prepare Lead Data' (replace YOUR_OWNER_NAME).\n3. **Phone number formatting** \u2014 the original stripped the '+' from the caller's number, then reused that broken format as the Twilio 'to' field. Twilio requires full E.164 (+15551234567) or the send fails. Fixed to keep the number intact.\n4. **Duplicate contacts** \u2014 changed GoHighLevel Contact operation from 'Create' to 'Create or Update' so a repeat caller updates their existing record instead of spawning a new one every call.\n5. **Missed-call detection widened** \u2014 the original only caught no-answer/busy/failed. Added the 'answered but hung up in under 5 seconds' case (voicemail bail / caller gave up before pickup), which is a real and common miss.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Verify before going live: the exact internal value for GoHighLevel's 'Create or Update' operation, and whether 'Create Opportunity' should read `$json.id` or `$json.contact.id` for the contact ID \u2014 this depends on your n8n/HighLevel node version, so test one run and check the actual output shape.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "note-fixes",
      "name": "README - Fixes Applied",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "twilio-missed-call",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-5e6f-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f3a4b5c6d",
      "name": "Twilio Call Status Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "twilio-missed-call-recovery"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ ['no-answer','busy','failed'].includes($json.body.CallStatus) || ($json.body.CallStatus === 'completed' && parseInt($json.body.CallDuration || '0', 10) <= 5) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "2b3c4d5e-6f7a-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a4b5c6d7e",
      "name": "Filter Missed Calls",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [450, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "values": {
          "string": [
            {
              "name": "callerPhone",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.From }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "calledNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.To }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "callSid",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.CallSid }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "leadTag",
              "value": "missed-call-lead"
            },
            {
              "name": "ownerName",
              "value": "YOUR_OWNER_NAME"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3c4d5e6f-7a8b-9c0d-1e2f-3a4b5c6d7e8f",
      "name": "Prepare Lead Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [650, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "firstName": "HVAC Lead",
        "lastName": "Missed Call",
        "phone": "={{ $json.callerPhone }}",
        "email": "",
        "additionalFields": {
          "tags": ["hvac-inbound-missed", "missed-call-lead"],
          "customFields": [
            {
              "fieldKey": "called_phone_number",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.calledNumber }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldKey": "call_sid",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.callSid }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4d5e6f7a-8b9c-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c6d7e8f9a",
      "name": "Create or Update Lead in GoHighLevel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.highLevel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [850, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "highLevelOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GHL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "GoHighLevel account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "opportunity",
        "operation": "create",
        "pipelineId": "YOUR_PIPELINE_ID",
        "pipelineStageId": "YOUR_STAGE_ID",
        "contactId": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "name": "=Missed Call - {{ $('Prepare Lead Data').item.json.callerPhone }} - {{ $now.toFormat('MM/dd/yyyy HH:mm') }}",
        "status": "open",
        "monetaryValue": 0
      },
      "id": "5e6f7a8b-9c0d-1e2f-3a4b-5c6d7e8f9a0b",
      "name": "Create Opportunity in GoHighLevel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.highLevel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1050, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "highLevelOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GHL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "GoHighLevel account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "from": "YOUR_TWILIO_NUMBER",
        "to": "={{ $('Prepare Lead Data').item.json.callerPhone }}",
        "message": "=Hey, sorry I missed you! Are you looking for AC repair or installation? - {{ $('Prepare Lead Data').item.json.ownerName }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6f7a8b9c-0d1e-2f3a-4b5c-6d7e8f9a0b1c",
      "name": "Send SMS via Twilio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Twilio account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Twilio Call Status Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Missed Calls",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Missed Calls": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Lead Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Lead Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create or Update Lead in GoHighLevel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create or Update Lead in GoHighLevel": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Opportunity in GoHighLevel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create Opportunity in GoHighLevel": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send SMS via Twilio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "your-instance-id"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "1",
  "triggerCount": 1,
  "tags": [],
  "active": false
}
